-- Brand rename: user-facing "lool" -> "loollook" (owner request 2026-11-09).
-- Identifiers are protected and left unchanged: product slugs (lool-8663 ...),
-- why-lool route, lool_/lool:/lool.work tokens. Existing "loollook" text
-- (e.g. hello@loollook.com) is shielded so it doesn't become "loollooklook".
-- Only rows that actually contain the brand word are touched.

